  {
    "description": "Queue background work the user asks for. The user confirms first; the portal shows its progress and tells you the outcome. The kinds here: "sweep" runs the org sweeps now (target "all" or "nightly", or one of bus factor, stale docs, orphan decisions); "bot-run" runs one bot now (target: the bot); "job" queues one of the suggested jobs for the fleet (target: the suggestion); "dispatch" dispatches a work item to an agent (target: the work item; model: Haiku, Sonnet or Opus if the user named one); the card shows the forecast; "finding-promote" turns a finding into a job (target: the finding); "finding-analyze" analyses a document finding (target: the finding); "change-rereview" re-reviews an agent change (target: the change); "change-address" has an agent address a change's review comments (target: the change); "deck" builds a status deck, a PowerPoint (target: the initiative in Work, the team in Assessment, the run in Pipelines, the channel in Social; in Work, on an initiative's page, scope "this-page" builds it for the initiative in view, and focus carries what it should cover); "summarize" summarises a conversation (target: the initiative in Work, the channel in Social); "diagram" draws a diagram of a conversation (target as summarize); "doc" drafts a document from a conversation (target as summarize).",
